OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry, bright start but cloud
OL,6,Ftending to increase leaving variable
OL,7,Fcloud and bright or sunny spells. A
OL,8,Ffew showers developing into the
OL,9,Fafternoon, possibly thundery. Feeling
OL,10,Fvery warm again but turning cooler
OL,11,Ffrom the north later in the evening.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FMostly dry overnight with
OL,14,Fclear periods edging south, although
OL,15,Fisolated showers may linger toward the
OL,16,Fsouth of the region. A cooler feeling
OL,17,Fnight than recently, with winds
OL,18,Fremaining mainly light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
