OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FLargely dry with sunny
OL,6,Fspells and patchy amounts of cloud.
OL,7,FFeeling fresher than recent days with
OL,8,Fa gentle breeze.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunday
OL,11,Fand Monday, largely dry with bright or
OL,12,Fsunny spells. Mainly light winds.
OL,13,FCloudier and breezier Tuesday, with
OL,14,Fsome patchy rain or showers.
OL,15,FTemperatures nearer average.
